Task result. thread_id: 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001.
The subagent runs in an isolated thread. This call waits for it to finish and returns its final report with status (completed, failed, or cancelled); failures include the error and partial result separately.
To continue this subagent, call task with thread_id 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001, subagent_type, and prompt.
This continuation supersedes earlier queued prompts; only the latest prompt receives a result.
